@prefix TS29520_Nnwdaf_AnalyticsInfo: <http://ericsson.com/models/3gpp/TS29520/Nnwdaf_AnalyticsInfo#> .
@prefix TS29520_Nnwdaf_EventsSubscription: <http://ericsson.com/models/3gpp/TS29520/Nnwdaf_EventsSubscription#> .
@prefix TS29571_CommonData: <http://ericsson.com/models/3gpp/TS29571/CommonData#> .
